      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>So I had the idea to play solo games of vengence to test out the new heroes in wrath of the cosmos and it seems like everyone plays pretty well against all of the villains except for Fright Train. He just seems to wreck everyone. I went back and started playing other heroes and found the same thing, just so much damage so fast. It is not all that uncommon for him to deal 10 damage on the first or second turn.</p><p>I have always found vengeance to be difficult to beat. I never really put my finger on why, but now I think it is the Fright Train Factor. I am looking forward to the VotM having gone through this testing.&nbsp;</p>",
